# Withdrawn for Phase 2: this fragment defines no site block.
#
# https://phlogiston.app is the participant origin and is served by
# community-live (127.0.0.1:3210). Its Caddy site block is owned by the
# atproto-community PCV0 kit (deploy/public-community-pcv0/Caddyfile.fragment),
# not by this packet. phlogiston-web (127.0.0.1:8092) is not publicly routed in
# Phase 2 because it would collide with community-live on `/` and `/oauth/*`.
#
# To route phlogiston-web again, define a site block here for a distinct
# hostname (never phlogiston.app, never phlogiston.social or
# *.phlogiston.social) and deploy with `deploy-inert.sh --with-status-web`.
# preflight.py refuses a phlogiston.app site block in this file.
# See docs/PUBLIC-SURFACES.md.
#
# The phlogiston.social PDS route is deliberately absent. Add it only with
# separately approved PDS identity, state, secrets, backup and activation.
